# Internal working docs — planning, roadmap, analysis, audits, refactor notes,
# and go-to-market strategy. These stay local and must never be cited by
# public docs, source comments, commit messages, or release material.
.planning/
.agents/
.claude/skills/
docs/private/
docs/ROADMAP.md
docs/PLAN.md
docs/proposals/
